Blokky is a three-dimensional mosaic and jigsaw puzzle in one app with great graphics. The game is suitable for children and adults, helps you relax after studying or work, and is completely free. By downloading the application with colored pixel 3D blocks, you get a full-fledged anti-stress world.

Game features
Blokky is a three-dimensional mosaic and paint-by-numbers puzzle with colorful blocks of different sizes and shapes. The game is a peculiar constructor, where the elements are overlapping and assembled into a multi-layered puzzle. The result is a bright pixel art mosaic that you can save on your smartphone, post on social media or send to friends to show them your skills. Arrange a tournament to see who can put together the best pixel art painting! Play anywhere at your convenience!

You will find many puzzles in the app:
- Bright colorful 3D pictures — fruits, plants, animals;
- Classic game art — comic book characters, superweapons, racing cars;
- cartoon drawings — heroes of famous cartoons and cartoon series;
- themed puzzles — anime, movie characters, etc.

Putting together a picture by numbers is fun and easy. Select the original picture, click and drag the puzzle pieces from the bottom panel directly to the playing field. Follow the hints, as they help you understand what picture to fix in each part of the playing field. In only 5 to 10 minutes, you get ready a colorful multi-layered construction of colored dice. The paint-by-numbers puzzles are assembled from scratch, delighting users with their colorfulness and originality.

Mosaic possibilities
The development team loves to draw and design, so they specifically created this game to relax in between activities. Collecting three-dimensional pictures by pixels is almost like meditation. It allows you to get rid of stress and anxiety. Now anyone can not only relax, but also show their creativity, using 3D constructor drawings.

Blokky allows to:
- put together amazing puzzles that are not often found in other apps;
- relax the mind, as in coloring games;
- move the cubes and pictures with your fingers;
- create unique pixel art;
- use special challenging levels;
- share achievements with friends.

The three-dimensional art mosaic can be assembled in silence. If you are bored, use ASMR extension: each docking of cubes on the cells will be accompanied by vibration. You relax and train your mind at the same time.

The application is customizable, which allows you to make the gameplay pleasant and non-intrusive. You can set the desired parameters, disable music and vibration in Settings.

The anti-stress game is optimal for:
- boys and girls: it is good for developing perseverance, observation, and brain activity;
- students: it helps to relax after lectures and seminars;
- adults: it is a great tool for relaxing after a hard day’s work.

Many puzzle games, coloring games, puzzles, and number puzzles have mechanics similar to Blokky. However, the app has a distinguishing feature — three-dimensional blocks are hard to distinguish from the real ones. With their help you will create something new without spending a lot of time and effort, while playing in between lessons or in the evening after a busy day.

